# Generated by Cargo
debug/
target/
**/target/

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc internal compiler error dumps
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Proof-of-concept measurement output (commit summaries in docs/poc-reports/ instead)
poc/*/results/

# Frame-ledger dumps and captures (may contain game data; never committed)
*.ledger
*.capture

# Never commit keys or secrets (docs/09-legal-and-content.md)
*.keys
.env
.env.*

# Claude Code: personal settings and agent worktrees
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
